    "_X5_note": "Constructors are birth. SETUP defines the blueprint. Constructors bring blueprints to life. The quality of construction determines the quality of everything that follows — a poorly constructed instance poisons all downstream operations.",
    "_X5_scripture": "Genesis 2:7 — And the LORD God formed man of the dust of the ground, and breathed into his nostrils the breath of life; and man became a living soul."
